<title>USA: Citicorp Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.85		    $1.79</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.85		    $1.62</p>
<p> Net			935,000		  877,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,362,000		4,983,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     485,600		  518,000</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.53		    $5.29</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$5.45		    $4.72</p>
<p> Net		    2,801,000		2,559,000</p>
<p> Revs		  15,795,000	     14,571,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call concensus estimate was $1.87/shr.</p>
<p>Q3 net included after tax charge of $40 million for U.S. Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding charge, net income was $975 million, or $1.93/shr, on revenues of $5.43 bln.</p>
<p>Revenue is adjusted revenue after credit card securitizations of $360 million vs $219 million in quarter and $1.00 bln vs $667 million in nine months; and net cost to carry, which was gain $8 million vs cost $7 million in quarter and gain $39 million vs cost $15 million in nine months.</p>
</text>
